Alex: On today's show.

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,340
Alex: Elon backs Jensen like a superstar.

12
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:37,900
Alex: Committee votes despite boycott.

13
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:41,590
Alex: Ukraine drops drones, blows up bridge.

14
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:46,060
Alex: Microsoft CEO warns AI agents could upend web ads.

15
